# Cloudflare Workers static assets read this from the build output, and ignore `_redirects` —
# `not_found_handling` in `wrangler.design.jsonc` is its equivalent. The policy and the
# `robots.txt` interaction are written down once, in `robots.txt` beside this file.
#
# A header reaches what a `<meta>` cannot: `meta.json`, the hashed assets and the fonts are
# each a fetchable URL with no document to carry a tag. `noindex` alone, deliberately — no
# `nofollow`, because nothing here links anywhere a crawler should be stopped from following.
#
# ⚠ ACAO stays on this one rule, and exactly one rule may ever match a path. Both platforms
# apply every matching rule and comma-join a repeated value, so a second `/*` would serve
# `*, *` — which is invalid, and no browser accepts it. Workers supplies no ACAO of its own
# (Pages did), and sydevs/SahajCloud#913 reads these assets cross-origin (#184).
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
